      "frontier": [
        "No automatic explorer/model call or LAYA service integration; frontier responses identify where explicit exploration starts."
      ],
      "guidance": [
        "Machine detection returns status=frontier for unknown procedures/states or schema drift and quarantines execution failures with no bound recipe.",
        "Bind a recipe with neyvia.manual.recovery.bind(runId,chapter,procedure,inputs), then select neyvia.manual.recover(runId,recipeId).",
        "Patch operations support chapter-scoped JSON Patch test/add/remove/replace; promotion is explicit and workspace-local.",
        "Removed procedures stay in parent snapshots and lineage demoted[]; obsolete scripts/recipes cannot run against newer hashes."
